/    (gline0p) on every fire -- the lexer freed the old glinep before
/    reassigning but not gline0p.  Value check: the watch still fires and the
/    good ones still work (leak is covered by the ASan sweep, not here).
c:0
watch(`a;"c+:1")
a:1
a:2
